{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>משגיא</b> — from <b>אל שגיא</b>." "<b>ויאבדם</b> — the opposite of <b>משגיא</b>." "<b>שוטח</b> — from \"וישטחו להם\"; like פורש, and the meaning is disperses and scatters." "<b>וינחם</b> — the opposite of the matter."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:02:28.826776688Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}